{%- doc -%}
  DRAFT ONLY (homepage draft in the work copy theme, 27 Oct 2026): a dashed label above a section that says which part
  of the planned homepage it is and what to decide. Remove every label section before the homepage goes live.

  @param {string} number - Position on the page, e.g. "2".
  @param {string} title - Name of the part, e.g. "Trust strip".
  @param {string} [note] - What it shows or what Anu decides.
{%- enddoc -%}
<div class="ea-draft-label">
  <p>
    <strong>DRAFT {{ number }} · {{ title }}</strong>
    {%- if note != blank %} — {{ note }}{% endif -%}
  </p>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .ea-draft-label {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  .ea-draft-label p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border: 2px dashed #b83a00;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #fff4ee;
    color: #001e26;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
